WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.377
Once upon a time, there was a beautiful pond in the forest.

2
00:00:04.378 --> 00:00:06.741
The frogs lived there happily.

3
00:00:06.742 --> 00:00:08.871
"What a pleasant life!

4
00:00:08.872 --> 00:00:13.177
We have everything we want here," they all agreed.

5
00:00:13.178 --> 00:00:16.784
"But we have no king," said one frog.

6
00:00:16.785 --> 00:00:22.771
"You know, all the other animals in this forest have a king."

7
00:00:22.772 --> 00:00:28.864
"Yes, all of the other animals are proud of their kings," said another frog.

8
00:00:28.865 --> 00:00:34.352
"They might tease us because we do not have one," the frogs said to each other.

9
00:00:34.353 --> 00:00:40.720
"Let's ask the Forest God for a king," suggested one frog.

10
00:00:40.722 --> 00:00:43.995
So the frogs went to the Forest God.

11
00:00:43.996 --> 00:00:49.102
"Forest God, will you grant us a favor?" they asked.

12
00:00:49.103 --> 00:00:50.477
"What is it?"

13
00:00:50.478 --> 00:00:52.942
"We want to have a king."

14
00:00:52.943 --> 00:00:55.138
"You are free and happy now.

15
00:00:55.139 --> 00:01:00.388
Why do you want a king?" asked the Forest God.

16
00:01:00.389 --> 00:01:02.214
The frogs explained.

17
00:01:02.215 --> 00:01:07.167
"All the other animals have a king, but we don't."

18
00:01:07.168 --> 00:01:10.565
"Yes, they might laugh at us."

19
00:01:10.566 --> 00:01:15.591
"Forest God, please give us a king," the frogs said.

20
00:01:15.592 --> 00:01:20.102
"You should be happy with what you have," said the Forest God.

21
00:01:20.103 --> 00:01:25.693
"But since you insist, I will grant you your wish,"

22
00:01:25.694 --> 00:01:29.244
The happy frogs went home to wait for their king.

23
00:01:29.245 --> 00:01:34.128
Suddenly, a log fell from the sky. Splash!

24
00:01:34.129 --> 00:01:37.958
"Run! Something is attacking us!"

25
00:01:37.959 --> 00:01:41.649
cried the frogs, and they hid at the bottom of the pond.

26
00:01:41.650 --> 00:01:45.178
After a while, the pond was quiet again.

27
00:01:45.179 --> 00:01:52.508
"Oh, it must be our king," suggested one of the frogs.

28
00:01:52.509 --> 00:01:54.650
"Yes, our king is here.

29
00:01:54.651 --> 00:01:58.066
Let's go bow to him," they decided.

30
00:01:58.067 --> 00:02:01.818
But the frogs found that their king did not move at all.

31
00:02:01.819 --> 00:02:05.840
"It is only a log!" said one.

32
00:02:05.841 --> 00:02:10.310
So they sat on the log and made faces at it!

33
00:02:10.311 --> 00:02:13.144
The frogs were unhappy with their king.

34
00:02:13.145 --> 00:02:15.134
"What a foolish king!

35
00:02:15.135 --> 00:02:17.638
Our king is not a real king."

36
00:02:17.639 --> 00:02:21.144
"The other animals might make fun of our king."

37
00:02:21.145 --> 00:02:27.575
"Let's go back to the Forest God and request a real king," they said to each other.

38
00:02:27.576 --> 00:02:32.074
So the frogs went to the Forest God again.

39
00:02:32.075 --> 00:02:38.230
"Mighty God! Please give us a real king," they asked.

40
00:02:38.231 --> 00:02:42.561
The Forest God was surprised that they did not like their king.

41
00:02:42.562 --> 00:02:48.372
"Hmm. Okay, I will send another king," he announced.

42
00:02:48.373 --> 00:02:52.488
The happy frogs went home to wait for the new king.

43
00:02:52.489 --> 00:02:56.171
Soon, an eel appeared in the pond.

44
00:02:56.172 --> 00:03:00.402
"Hello! I am your new king," he said.

45
00:03:00.403 --> 00:03:02.903
"Let's get along well together."

46
00:03:02.904 --> 00:03:06.632
"Hooray!" The frogs were happy.

47
00:03:06.633 --> 00:03:10.079
"We will obey everything you say."

48
00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:13.797
But the gentle eel never told them to do anything.

49
00:03:13.798 --> 00:03:18.084
He just enjoyed swimming in the pond.

50
00:03:18.085 --> 00:03:20.661
So the frogs held another meeting.

51
00:03:20.662 --> 00:03:22.780
"This king is no good.

52
00:03:22.781 --> 00:03:26.067
The eel is too good-natured to be a king."

53
00:03:26.068 --> 00:03:27.339
"You are right.

54
00:03:27.340 --> 00:03:30.175
The other animals laugh at him too."

55
00:03:30.176 --> 00:03:37.085
"Let's go back to the Forest God and demand a better king!" they said.

56
00:03:37.086 --> 00:03:40.127
The frogs went to the Forest God again.

57
00:03:40.128 --> 00:03:45.973
"Mighty God, please send us a better king," they demanded.

58
00:03:45.974 --> 00:03:55.043
"Yes, send us the strongest king, or we will keep coming back to ask for another."

59
00:03:55.044 --> 00:03:57.417
The Forest God was angry.

60
00:03:57.418 --> 00:04:01.922
"I have sent you two good kings that let you live freely.

61
00:04:01.923 --> 00:04:04.205
But you were not satisfied!

62
00:04:04.206 --> 00:04:08.907
Very well, I will send you a big, strong king!"

63
00:04:08.908 --> 00:04:13.895
The frogs went happily home to wait for their strong king.

64
00:04:13.896 --> 00:04:19.692
"Now the other animals will not laugh at our king," they said.

65
00:04:19.693 --> 00:04:23.267
Soon, the Forest God sent a heron to the pond.

66
00:04:23.268 --> 00:04:26.864
When the frogs saw the heron, they were happy.

67
00:04:26.865 --> 00:04:29.405
"Oh, look at our new king!"

68
00:04:29.406 --> 00:04:33.751
"He looks so tall and wonderful!"

69
00:04:33.752 --> 00:04:37.181
But the heron picked up a frog and ate it.

70
00:04:37.182 --> 00:04:42.144
"Oh my! Run! Run!" the others cried.

71
00:04:42.145 --> 00:04:43.819
But it was too late.

72
00:04:43.820 --> 00:04:49.383
The heron devoured frog after frog until there were none left in the pond.

73
00:04:49.384 --> 00:04:53.228
The Forest God watched the heron fly away and thought,

74
00:04:53.229 --> 00:04:58.100
"Sometimes it is best to be satisfied with what you have."

